WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:06.433
scRNA-seq profiles ~20,000 unordered genes per cell.

2
00:00:06.433 --> 00:00:12.867
Standard Transformers hit an O(G²) wall (~40 h on one GPU).

3
00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:20.500
Meet SAVE (ICLR 2026): LLM-guided Gene Blocks + Latent Flow Matching.

4
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.567
Unlike 2D image grids, genes form an unordered, sparse set.

5
00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:37.467
SAVE encodes NCBI Gene summaries into 1,536-dim GenePT LLM embeddings.

6
00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:44.667
Balanced Optimal Transport soft-patches genes into pathway-coherent Gene Blocks.

7
00:00:45.567 --> 00:00:53.033
A Gene-Block Attention VAE compresses blocks into pathway-structured latents.

8
00:00:53.033 --> 00:01:03.900
DiT Conditional OT Flow Matching: AdaLN, condition masking (p = 0.6) & CFG.

9
00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:08.033
Generates accurate multi-condition cell states in just 20 ODE steps.

10
00:01:08.933 --> 00:01:16.767
Grouping 19,112 genes into L = 6 blocks collapses attention from O(G²) to O(L²).

11
00:01:16.767 --> 00:01:24.967
Single-RTX-3090 training drops from 2,391.2 min to 12.5 min (191× speedup).

12
00:01:24.967 --> 00:01:31.267
Reaching 266× at K = 5,600 (9.0 min), and ~7 min per run on Colab G4.

13
00:01:32.167 --> 00:01:38.200
With one fixed configuration, SAVE achieves strong gains across 8 benchmarks.

14
00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:44.433
SOTA dual-condition generation on Heart (WD 8.30), PBMC (5.37) & Lung Atlas (4.37).

15
00:01:44.433 --> 00:01:49.767
Reliable zero-shot extrapolation to unseen 5-covariate Lung Cancer combinations.

16
00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:57.800
Zero task-specific objectives: up to 0.83 scIB in batch effect correction.

17
00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:02.867
0.96 avg PCC / 0.86 R² on leave-one-out PBMC IFN-β perturbation prediction.

18
00:02:02.867 --> 00:02:11.867
Attention recovers fatty acid β-oxidation in cardiomyocytes & filters noise.

19
00:02:12.767 --> 00:02:16.100
Everything is engineered for verified one-click reproduction.

20
00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:25.167
Launch Colab or run 1 CLI command to reproduce Tables 1–5 (11 datasets).

21
00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:29.100
Backed by verified Colab Pro+ G4 logs (88m 15s parallel Tables 1–4).

22
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.433
Explore paper, code & Colab at save.argonx.dev
